r=['# Hoops Dynasty — Phase 4 competitive balance audit','', 'Baseline: Phase 3 commit 42eee072d688f3ed058163a7bc7822ce66e6b448. Ten independent full NBA regular seasons (12,300 games) and ten independent full WNBA regular seasons (2,400 games), seeds 101–110. These use fictional generated rosters, not verified historical player populations. They are independent seasons, not twenty consecutive career years. All Phase 2/3 source corrections and retained baseline results are preserved.','', '## Outcome and scope','', 'This update corrects an open-shot contest inconsistency and reduces the modern crowd-effect scale. It does not declare the blowout problem solved. The rotation-aware strength model remains a diagnostic: its independent evaluation is reported below, without adding any team-level gameplay bonus or silently replacing every use of the existing rating.','', 'The two production mechanics changes affect future games only. No saved ratings, completed results, contracts, rosters, schedules, GM history, or city photographs are rewritten. No score caps, comeback bonuses, forced margins, rating compression, or roster equalization were introduced.','', '## Full-season results','', 'Percent rows are percentages. Reference ORtg/DRtg below use the same simple possession estimator as the audit, not official advanced-rating definitions. The full-season spread errors continue to evaluate the original OVR-based prediction; the separate rotation-model evaluation is not substituted into these results.']
